Subject: [PATCH] fix(edm): count orbit radius in sinker rough and finish
 sizing

Judge the swept electrode width and use a lateral-radius-adjusted floor stand.
Pin the allowed patterns and named refusals with simulation and mutation checks.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1355
